0..76 Comment "// What a suspension refuses. A decode of a filled code is rigid, so a value"
77..153 Comment "// of another type is refused there; a comparison between the decodes of two"
154..230 Comment "// owed codes has no rigid side, so it is the unifier\'s question and refused"
231..303 Comment "// here, not deferred; and a declaration with one comparison waiting and"
304..382 Comment "// another refused is refused, the refusal winning over the wait (Slattery and"
383..454 Comment "// Sterling, _Bidirectional Elaborators à la Carte_, arXiv:2607.09564,"
455..473 Comment "// Corollary 5.2)."
